//! This repository's C API (the headers in include/) implemented on
//! maplibre-native-next, a port of MapLibre Native's core to Rust
//! (https://github.com/louwers/maplibre-native-next), as a static library that
//! stands in for the C++ `maplibre_native_c` library.
//!
//! Ports the C API layer in src/ where this crate implements a function; every
//! other function of the API is a stub in `stubs.rs` (generated by
//! tools/gen_stubs.py) that returns MLN_STATUS_UNSUPPORTED.

